+    // patch 0067: batch-invariant mode takes it too. Without the fold an N-column split step computes MUL and seven ADDs
+    // where every other step computes the fused fold (its sum contracts to FMAs): other bits, so a client's bytes moved
+    // with LLAMA_EXPERT_STORE_SPLIT_COLS=1 and with the size of the batch.
